{
  "rule": "GFM reference-family shape rules (wire-contract design §3): footnoteDefinition/footnoteReference require identifier; definition requires identifier + url; linkReference/imageReference require identifier + referenceType. Valid parser output is preserved verbatim (nulls included). A node missing a required field degrades to crowiOpaque{reason:\"invalid-shape\"} in the v1 envelope — only that node, never the page. definition.url follows the §8 general URL allow-list (violation → \"#\", node kept).",
  "why": "The parent spec left GFM reference behaviour as an open question (no repo test existed); this file resolves it by fixing BOTH directions — valid shapes are preserved, required-field-less shapes degrade to a visible opaque node — so neither client can silently drop or silently over-accept the reference family.",
  "consumers": [
    "packages/api/src/renderer/golden-corpus.test.ts",
    "apps/apple/CrowiKit/Tests/CrowiKitTests/RenderedAstGoldenCorpusTests.swift"
  ],
  "consumerContract": "The api jest driver asserts the PRODUCER side (markdown → expectedAst via runPipeline with an empty registry, and storedAst/expectedAst → expectedEnvelope via sanitizeAst). The CrowiKit XCTest asserts the CONSUMER side (its sanitize-walker mirror over storedAst/expectedAst, and its strict envelope decoder over expectedEnvelope). The Swift consumer is wired up in Phase 4 (apps/apple lives on the feature-ios-app/impl branch).",
  "normalization": "none — expected values are exact.",
  "exclusions": "Plugin-dispatch output byte strings (Mermaid / PlantUML / link-card / shiki generated HTML) are deliberately NOT pinned by this corpus — packages/e2e/tests/renderer-plugins.spec.ts owns that coverage against a live server. The corpus pins parser/core-transform STRUCTURE and the v1 projection schema shapes only; where a stored html node value would be a generated byte string, the case either omits expectedAst (code.json) or uses a synthetic stand-in value the projection never reads (typed-nodes.json).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "footnote",
      "why": "valid footnoteReference/footnoteDefinition pair: identifier (required) and label survive both wire shapes",
      "markdown": "body text[^1]\n\n[^1]: the note",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "body text"
              },
              {
                "type": "footnoteReference",
                "identifier": "1",
                "label": "1"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "footnoteDefinition",
            "identifier": "1",
            "label": "1",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "the note"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "body text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "footnoteReference",
                  "identifier": "1",
                  "label": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "footnoteDefinition",
              "identifier": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "the note"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-reference-full",
      "why": "valid full-style linkReference + its definition: identifier/referenceType/label and definition url/title survive verbatim",
      "markdown": "[site][ref]\n\n[ref]: /docs \"Docs\"",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "linkReference",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "site"
                  }
                ],
                "label": "ref",
                "identifier": "ref",
                "referenceType": "full"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "identifier": "ref",
            "label": "ref",
            "title": "Docs",
            "url": "/docs"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "linkReference",
                  "identifier": "ref",
                  "referenceType": "full",
                  "label": "ref",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "value": "site"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "definition",
              "identifier": "ref",
              "url": "/docs",
              "label": "ref",
              "title": "Docs"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-reference-shortcut",
      "why": "referenceType distinguishes shortcut/collapsed/full — the shortcut form is the shape a second parser most easily normalizes away",
      "markdown": "[ref]\n\n[ref]: /docs",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "linkReference",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "ref"
                  }
                ],
                "label": "ref",
                "identifier": "ref",
                "referenceType": "shortcut"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "identifier": "ref",
            "label": "ref",
            "title": null,
            "url": "/docs"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "image-reference",
      "why": "valid imageReference: identifier/referenceType/label/alt preserved; the definition carries the url",
      "markdown": "![alt text][img]\n\n[img]: /images/a.png",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "imageReference",
                "alt": "alt text",
                "label": "img",
                "identifier": "img",
                "referenceType": "full"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "identifier": "img",
            "label": "img",
            "title": null,
            "url": "/images/a.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "imageReference",
                  "identifier": "img",
                  "referenceType": "full",
                  "label": "img",
                  "alt": "alt text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "definition",
              "identifier": "img",
              "url": "/images/a.png",
              "label": "img",
              "title": null
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-reference-missing-reference-type",
      "why": "referenceType is REQUIRED on linkReference — without it the node degrades to crowiOpaque{invalid-shape} in the v1 envelope (page survives)",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "linkReference",
                "identifier": "ref",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "site"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "crowiOpaque",
                  "reason": "invalid-shape",
                  "originalType": "linkReference"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "definition-missing-url",
      "why": "url is REQUIRED on definition — a definition without one is invalid-shape, not a definition with an empty target",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "identifier": "ref",
            "label": "ref"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiOpaque",
              "reason": "invalid-shape",
              "originalType": "definition"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "footnote-reference-missing-identifier",
      "why": "identifier is REQUIRED on footnoteReference (label alone cannot resolve the footnote association)",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "footnoteReference",
                "label": "note"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "crowiOpaque",
                  "reason": "invalid-shape",
                  "originalType": "footnoteReference"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "image-reference-missing-identifier",
      "why": "identifier is REQUIRED on imageReference",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "imageReference",
                "referenceType": "full",
                "alt": "alt text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "crowiOpaque",
                  "reason": "invalid-shape",
                  "originalType": "imageReference"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "link-reference-missing-identifier",
      "why": "identifier is REQUIRED on linkReference even when referenceType is present — the required-field set is a conjunction, and each omission must degrade on its own",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "linkReference",
                "referenceType": "full",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "site"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "crowiOpaque",
                  "reason": "invalid-shape",
                  "originalType": "linkReference"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "definition-missing-identifier",
      "why": "identifier is REQUIRED on definition even when url is present — a definition that cannot be referenced is invalid-shape, not an anonymous definition",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "label": "ref",
            "title": null,
            "url": "/docs"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiOpaque",
              "reason": "invalid-shape",
              "originalType": "definition"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "image-reference-missing-reference-type",
      "why": "referenceType is REQUIRED on imageReference even when identifier is present — mirrors link-reference-missing-reference-type so both required fields are tested on both reference node types",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "imageReference",
                "identifier": "img",
                "alt": "alt text"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "crowiOpaque",
                  "reason": "invalid-shape",
                  "originalType": "imageReference"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "footnote-definition-missing-identifier",
      "why": "identifier is REQUIRED on footnoteDefinition (label alone cannot resolve the footnote association) — the whole node including its children degrades to a single crowiOpaque",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "footnoteDefinition",
            "label": "note",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "the note"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "crowiOpaque",
              "reason": "invalid-shape",
              "originalType": "footnoteDefinition"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "definition-disallowed-scheme",
      "why": "definition.url follows the general URL allow-list (http/https/mailto/relative/fragment); a disallowed scheme degrades the url to \"#\" and KEEPS the node — same rule as link.url",
      "storedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "definition",
            "identifier": "ref",
            "label": "ref",
            "title": null,
            "url": "javascript:alert(1)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "definition",
              "identifier": "ref",
              "url": "#",
              "label": "ref",
              "title": null
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
